    "summary": "The user claims to possess a \"biological barometer\" ability to sense atmospheric pressure changes in their bones. The assistant initially declines to provide data and offers medical caution, but eventually provides scientific context that allows the user to interpret their sensation as valid, ultimately offering advice on how to track these \"sensations.\"",
